==Description==
'''v1.64.0''' is the one hundred and fifteenth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 14th of May 2025. It is a small update that contained balance changes, bugfixes and new maps.

This update has three versions, the main v1.64.0 (released 14 May 2025) and two minor updates, the v1.64.0a (released 26 May 2025) and v1.64.0b (released 26 May 2025).

==Additions==
*[[Lighthaos]] (Survival)
*[[Legacy Retro Zone]]
*New [[Codes|code]]: 4BVisits
**Gives one [[Premium Crate]].

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*[[Swarmer]] nerfed.
**Statistical changes:
***'''Level 0'''
****Stack limit decreased from 150 to 5.
****Global stack limit decreased from 5,000 to 1,500.
***'''Level 1'''
****Stack limit increased from +0 to +5.
***'''Level 2'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|500}} to {{Money|600}}.
****Stack limit increased from +0 to +5.
***'''Level 3'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|1,500}} to {{Money|2,000}}.
****Stack limit increased from +0 to +5.
***'''Level 4'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|3,000}} to {{Money|5,000}}.
****Stack limit increased from +0 to +5.
***'''Level 5'''
****Cost increased from {{Money|6,000}} to {{Money|9,500}}.
****Firerate changed from {{Tooltip|1.025 > 0.775|-0.25}} to {{Tooltip|1.025 > 0.525|0.5}}.
****Bee damage decreased from +1 to +0.
****Stack limit increased from +0 to +5.
*[[Retro Zone]] remade.
**Difficulty changed from {{Color|Normal}} to {{Color|Hard}}.
**[[All Paths]] added.
*[[Biologist]] Level 1 upgrade name changed from ''Bio Chemestry'' to ''Bio Chemistry''.
*[[Slasher]]'s bleed is no longer affected by [[Damage Buff]]s.
*Fixed unit collision damage not contributing damage requirements in [[Quests]] and [[Mission Quests]].
*Fixed [[Slasher]] not being able to apply bleed if the enemy has had bleed applied from another source.
*Fixed [[Brute]], [[Molten Warlord]] and [[Fallen Swordmaster]] being affected by the [[All Paths]] modifier.
*Fixed [[Gatling Gun]] being unable to damage [[Ducky Revenge Event]] enemies.
*Fixed [[Ripped Elf (Unit)|Ripped Elf]] having no animations.
*Fixed {{Color|Deluxe|Baseball}} [[Mortar]] skin having invisible projectiles.
*Fixed {{Color|Premium|Classic}} [[Humvee 3]] not playing its animations and sounds.
*Fixed {{Color|Premium|Galactic}} [[Commander]] having no firing animation at Level 4.
*Fixed {{Color|Deluxe|Neko}} [[Commander]] having no firing animation at Level 2–3.
*Fixed some tower and unit sounds not being affected by the [[Settings#Towers|Towers]] sound setting. This includes:
**{{Color|Halloween2019|Pumpkin}} [[Rocketeer]] sounds.
**Most [[Commander]] ability voicelines.
**[[Jester]] explosion sound effects.
**{{Color|Other|Mako}} [[DJ Booth]] ability voicelines.
*Fixed [[Scary Coffin]] emote sometimes teleporting the player into the void.

